Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\">ascended</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Raphael can <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack\" title=\"Multiattack\">Multiattack</a> in his Ascended Fiend form if all of his Soul Pillars have been destroyed and he has no Soul Charges. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_Raphael_Multiattack_Passive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_Raphael_Multiattack_Passive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_Raphael_Multiattack_Passive\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715042723\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 793/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6368/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2354/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 124/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 741294/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!-